{"page":230,"verses":[{"verse_key":"11:72","surah":11,"ayah":72,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَتْ يَـٰوَيْلَتَىٰٓ ءَأَلِدُ وَأَنَا۠ عَجُوزٌ وَهَـٰذَا بَعْلِى شَيْخًا ۖ إِنَّ هَـٰذَا لَشَىْءٌ عَجِيبٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"She said, ‘Alas for me! How am I to bear a child when I am an old woman, and my husband here is an old man? That would be a strange thing!’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَتْ","en_gloss":"She said","transliteration":"qālat","verse_key":"11:72"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَـٰوَيْلَتَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"Woe to me","transliteration":"yāwaylatā","verse_key":"11:72"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَأَلِدُ","en_gloss":"Shall I bear a child","transliteration":"a-alidu","verse_key":"11:72"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَأَنَا۠","en_gloss":"while I am","transliteration":"wa-anā","verse_key":"11:72"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَجُوزٌۭ","en_gloss":"an old woman","transliteration":"ʿajūzun","verse_key":"11:72"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَهَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"and this","transliteration":"wahādhā","verse_key":"11:72"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَعْلِى","en_gloss":"my husband","transliteration":"baʿlī","verse_key":"11:72"},{"pos":8,"ar":"شَيْخًا ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) an old man","transliteration":"shaykhan","verse_key":"11:72"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"11:72"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"11:72"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَشَىْءٌ","en_gloss":"(is) surely a thing","transliteration":"lashayon","verse_key":"11:72"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَجِيبٌۭ","en_gloss":"amazing","transliteration":"ʿajībun","verse_key":"11:72"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٧٢","en_gloss":"(72)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:72"}]},{"verse_key":"11:73","surah":11,"ayah":73,"ar_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟ أَتَعْجَبِينَ مِنْ أَمْرِ ٱللَّهِ ۖ رَحْمَتُ ٱللَّهِ وَبَرَكَـٰتُهُۥ عَلَيْكُمْ أَهْلَ ٱلْبَيْتِ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ حَمِيدٌ مَّجِيدٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They said, ‘Are you astonished at what God ordains? The grace of God and His blessings be upon you, people of this house! For He is worthy of all 